drivers/target/target_core_user.c:1424:9-10: WARNING: return of 0/1 in func=
tion 'tcmu_handle_completions' with return type bool

 Return statements in functions returning bool should use
 true/false instead of 1/0.
Generated by: scripts/coccinelle/misc/boolreturn.cocci

Fixes: 9814b55cde05 ("scsi: target: tcmu: Return from tcmu_handle_completio=
ns() if cmd_id not found")
